1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,340
Having zero pain sounds

2
00:00:01,340 --> 00:00:02,800
like an awesome superpower

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,820
until you realize pain

4
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:05,840
is your body's only

5
00:00:05,840 --> 00:00:07,280
warning system against self

6
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:07,840
-destruction.

7
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:09,220
Without it,

8
00:00:09,600 --> 00:00:10,380
you wouldn't pull your

9
00:00:10,380 --> 00:00:11,220
hand away from a

10
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,360
burning stove until you

11
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,380
smelled your own skin

12
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:13,900
scorching.

13
00:00:14,660 --> 00:00:15,420
You could walk around

14
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:16,280
on a broken ankle

15
00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:16,920
for days,

16
00:00:17,440 --> 00:00:18,840
permanently shattering the bone

17
00:00:18,840 --> 00:00:20,000
without ever noticing.

18
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:21,940
Even something as simple

19
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:22,680
as sleeping in an

20
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:24,240
awkward position could cut

21
00:00:24,240 --> 00:00:25,520
off circulation and cause

22
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:26,640
severe tissue damage.

23
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:28,440
People born with this

24
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,160
real medical condition rarely

25
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,220
survive past childhood because

26
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:33,560
they miss critical internal

27
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,340
alarms like appendicitis or

28
00:00:35,340 --> 00:00:36,080
internal bleeding.

29
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,000
Pain isn't your enemy.

30
00:00:38,740 --> 00:00:39,780
It's the bodyguard keeping

31
00:00:39,780 --> 00:00:40,380
you alive.
